1  Operational planning, Management (IM)
2 Infrastructure installations (IM)
3 Civil engineering causes (IM)
4 Causes of other IM (IM)
5 Commercial causes (RU)
6 Rolling stock (RU)
7 Causes of other RU (RU)
8 External causes
9 Secondary causes
